Z||000001||Oreif||04-24-2001||11:04 AM||||Usually it's an .ini file that keeps track of the evaluation time. You need to locat it. Usually in the windows directory.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Wade87GT||04-24-2001||11:14 AM||||Try changing the date on your computer back to about a day after you first installed the software (do a right click on the icon, then left click on properties, should have the date installed). Double click the time in the tray (bottom right corner of your desktop). Your time clock and date calender should pop up. Make your changes there. Simple "worth a try" might do it for you.<P>Wade||||reg||3
